WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.990
A family of young stars.

00:02.690 --> 00:07.416
The Pleiades are about a hundred million years old, which for a star is childhood.

00:07.866 --> 00:12.240
More than a thousand of them are held loosely together by gravity.

00:12.690 --> 00:19.130
The brightest are hot and blue, and the blue haze is a cloud of dust they happen to be passing through.
